      "title": "SDK Isomorphism",
      "items": [
        "Java/Dart/Python/TS/C 5 语言共享 P2PCommand 路由 + 同一 RPC 抽象；取消/事件/错误语义对齐"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "rose",
      "title": "StdCancel Uniform",
      "items": [
