      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "emerald",
      "title": "p2p-core Wire",
      "items": [
        "WS Client 将 SDK 发出的 RPC 直接编码为 p2p-core 兼容 frame；服务端可直接用 p2p-core Handler Registry + frame router"
      ]
